# gooddy — Design System Prompt (colours + typography)

Paste this whole prompt into Lovable, or save it as `.cursor/rules/gooddy-design.mdc` (or `.cursorrules`) in Cursor. It sets up the gooddy brand across the whole app.

---

## Role and goal

You are building **gooddy**, an all-in-one wellness app for women that adapts to the four phases of the menstrual cycle (cycle tracking, habits, food, movement, weight, journaling and knowledge in one place). Tagline: "Explore your body on a deeper level." For women, by women.

Apply the design system below to **every** screen and component. Use only these colours and fonts. Never introduce new hex values, default Tailwind colours (blue-500, gray-100…), pure white `#FFFFFF` backgrounds or pure black `#000000`.

**Brand feel:** warm, intimate, smart and a little glamorous, like a confidante who knows the science. Inspired by a pressed glitter eyeshadow pan: deep garnet, cream silk, velvet black and a rose-gold metal rim. It is *not* bubblegum pink, clinical or a gym app.

**Stack assumption:** React + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui. Colours are CSS variables in HSL (shadcn format), with a light theme ("Silk") and a dark theme ("Velvet") switched with the `.dark` class.

---

## 1. Fonts

Two Google Fonts:

- **Fraunces** (display serif): headlines, big numbers ("Day 14"), emotional words. Use the *italic* for emphasis words such as "glowing" or "you".
- **Plus Jakarta Sans** (text sans): everything functional, including body, buttons, inputs, labels and navigation.

Add to `index.html` `<head>`:

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,600;1,9..144,700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

### Type scale

| Style | Font | Size / line-height | Weight | Use |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `display-xl` | Fraunces | 64px / 64px | 500 | Splash, onboarding hero |
| `display-lg` | Fraunces | 44px / 48px | 500 | Screen hero ("Day 14, *glowing*") |
| `heading-1` | Fraunces | 32px / 38px | 500 | Page titles |
| `heading-2` | Fraunces | 24px / 30px | 500 | Section and card titles |
| `body` | Plus Jakarta Sans | 16px / 24px | 400 | Body text |
| `body-strong` | Plus Jakarta Sans | 16px / 24px | 600 | Buttons, emphasis |
| `small` | Plus Jakarta Sans | 14px / 20px | 400 | Captions, secondary info |
| `label` | Plus Jakarta Sans | 12px / 16px | 600 | UPPERCASE, letter-spacing 0.08em: eyebrows, tab labels, chip text |

Rules:
- Use sentence case everywhere. Uppercase is only for the `label` style.
- Fraunces italic headlines use `font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 100, "WONK" 1;` for the soft, rounded brand italic (same as the logo).
- Never use condensed or all-caps headlines.

