### What each token means

| Token | Light | Dark | Use |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `surface` | `#F7EFDF` | `#1C0A10` | Page background. Silk by day, velvet by night. |
| `surface-raised` | `#FFF8EE` | `#2A1219` | Cards, sheets and inputs sitting on surface. |
| `surface-sunken` | `#EFE4D2` | `#140609` | Grouped list backgrounds, input wells, the area behind cards on a dashboard. |
| `surface-inverse` | `#1C0A10` | `#F7EFDF` | Toasts, tooltips and snackbars: the opposite of the page surface. |
| `border` | `#E6D6C8` | `#3E2129` | Hairlines and card outlines. Decorative only, never the sole boundary of a control. |
| `border-strong` | `#8C7375` | `#8C7375` | Input and control borders, dividers that must be seen (3.8:1 on silk, 4.4:1 on velvet). |
| `ink` | `#1C0A10` | `#F7EFDF` | Body text and headlines on surface and surface-raised (16.7:1 light, 15.3:1 dark). |
| `ink-muted` | `#6B4A52` | `#C9AEB3` | Secondary text, captions, timestamps on surface (6.7:1 light, 9.3:1 dark). |
| `ink-subtle` | `#8C7375` | `#8C7375` | Placeholder text and disabled labels only (3.8:1 on silk). Never for content. |
| `ink-inverse` | `#F7EFDF` | `#1C0A10` | Text on surface-inverse. |
| `brand` | `#8B182D` | `#F0788C` | The brand as UI: primary buttons, links, active tab, key headline words. On dark it lifts to a readable rose (7.1:1 on surface). |
| `on-brand` | `#F7EFDF` | `#1C0A10` | Text and icons on a brand fill (8.1:1 light). |
| `brand-hover` | `#72011E` | `#FEA3B1` | Primary button hover/pressed (garnet-800 in light). |
| `brand-tint` | `#FEE6E6` | `#3A0F1A` | Selected rows, active nav pill, highlighted cards. Brand text on it reads 7.8:1 light, 6.2:1 dark. |
| `link` | `#A6444D` | `#F0788C` | Inline links in body text (5.2:1 on silk). Underlined. |
| `focus-ring` | `#A6444D` | `#F0788C` | Keyboard focus: 2px ring with a 2px surface gap. |

### Fixed identity colours (same in both themes)

- **Garnet** `#8B182D`: the brand. Logo, splash, marketing panels. Silk text on it.
- **Silk** `#F7EFDF`: cream. The light background, and text on garnet.
- **Velvet** `#1C0A10`: near-black. Text, and the dark theme background.
- **Rose gold** `#D8A08E`: metal accent like jewellery. Thin borders on hero cards, sparkle icons, the "Plus" premium badge. Never a background for body text on light surfaces.
- **Blush** `#F3D6D3`: soft highlight panels and quote cards.

