| chart-1 (garnet) | `#8B182D` | `#D68E90` |
| chart-2 (gilded) | `#9E8052` | `#D6B485` |
| chart-3 (dusk) | `#4F6097` | `#B3C0E4` |
| chart-4 (sage) | `#3F765A` | `#87B099` |
| chart-5 (peony) | `#C26676` | `#FEA3B1` |
| chart-6 (mulberry) | `#905078` | `#DBB3CA` |

When a chart is *about the cycle* (energy by phase, symptoms by phase), colour it by the phase fills instead. Label lines directly instead of relying only on a legend.

