## 7. How to use the colours (rules for every screen)

**Balance 60 / 30 / 10.** About 60% background (silk, or velvet in dark mode), 30% garnet plus text, and 10% accents (rose gold, blush, phase colours). If a screen looks "pink", pull it back to garnet and silk.

**Buttons**
- Primary: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-hover rounded-md h-11 font-semibold`. Use **one per screen**.
- Secondary: `bg-card text-foreground border border-input rounded-md`.
- Destructive: `bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground`. Rare, and always confirmed.
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-2 ring-ring ring-offset-2 ring-offset-background`.

**Cards**
- Default: `bg-card border border-border rounded-md p-4`.
- Hero / feature card: `rounded-pan` with an optional 1–2px rose-gold inner border (`ring-1 ring-rose-gold/60`), like the metal rim of a pan.
- Today card: `bg-{phase}-tint text-{phase}-ink rounded-pan`.

**Phase chip:** `inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-7 px-3 rounded-pill bg-ovulation-tint text-ovulation-ink text-[13px] font-semibold`, with a 10px dot in `bg-ovulation`.

**Navigation:** bottom tab bar on `bg-background border-t border-border`. Active tab is `text-primary font-semibold`, inactive is `text-muted-foreground`. Labels: Today, Cycle, Track, Learn, You.

**Text:** body `text-foreground`, secondary `text-muted-foreground`, links `text-link underline underline-offset-2`.

**Dark mode:** never pure black or grey. The background is velvet `#1C0A10` and cards are `#2A1219`. In dark mode the primary colour becomes rose `#F0788C` with velvet text.

**Shape:** generous rounded corners. `rounded-pan` (28px) is the signature. Soft shadows only, if any: `shadow-[0_8px_24px_-12px_rgba(28,10,16,0.25)]`.

**Sparkle motif:** a small four-point star (✦) in rose gold marks insights, tips and Plus features. Use one or two per screen, never a pattern.

**Glitter texture:** only on the splash screen, the app icon and at most one hero image. Normal UI surfaces stay flat.

