## 8. Voice for UI copy

Warm, frank and smart, like a friend who knows the science. Second person, short sentences, no guilt.

- ✅ "Day 14, *glowing*" · "Peak week. Your energy's high, so make plans." · "Missed a day? Pick up where you are." · "Your energy's lower this week. That's the luteal phase, not you."
- ❌ "You broke your streak!" · "That time of the month" · exclamation-mark overload · medical jargon without explanation.

---

## 9. Don'ts

- No default Tailwind palette colours, no `#FFFFFF` or `#000000`, no blue links.
- No purple-blue gradients, no neon, no bubblegum-pink backgrounds.
- No condensed all-caps headlines.
- Phase colours are never decoration.
- Rose gold is never used as body text on a light background.
- Don't use red (error) for cycle events.
- Every text/background pair must reach at least 4.5:1 contrast. Use the token pairs above as given.

